 everyday chores.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A cozy simulation </strong>- the above points make you sweaty? Relax and have-a-go! Pizza Slice at its heart is a romantic and humorous depiction of what it means to run a modern restaurant business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A portion for two </strong>- you will have your unique staff at the restaurant but why not invite a friend and play together? It\u2019s half the buzz and double the fun!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An online competition</strong> - join the Inferno Kitchen and compete againts other players online in the ultimate pizza cook-off challenge!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1385290/extras/db725efe59b77c56dbc92595c7257298.avif?t=1775585441\" width=610 height=179 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Quest Craft","Gaming Factory"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1385290/36b3296f7d8b5c2fc447d73bf6c525ca70218f0c/header.jpg?t=1775585441","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1385290/1110676315/0bd289aa4db153c92db5bbadbf0f311963c076c6/1773421844/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773426216","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/13